<title>USA: Airborne Express moves Orange County base.</title>
<headline>Airborne Express moves Orange County base.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airborne Express said it has relocated its Orange County warehouse and sorting operation near Los Angeles into a new facility in nearby Long Beach.</p>
<p>The new built-to-suit facility features 45,000 square feet of office and warehouse space with 90 interior van loading positions and takes over work performed at the company's old Orange County facility in Garden Grove, California. Over 70 people will be employed at the new location.</p>
<p>-- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
